why The Alliance paladin's rare two-handed mace for the 20s, with a shield on the way.

# The Alliance Paladin weapon chain: The Tome of Valor (1793 Human, 1794
# Dwarf, then 1649-1652: Daphne Stilwell's stand in Westfall, Bastion of
# Stormwind) and The Test of Righteousness (1653, 1654, 1806: Jordan Stilwell
# outside Ironforge forges Verigan's Fist from four parts), with Bailor's Ore
# Shipment (1655) and Seeking the Kor Gem (1442) for two of the parts.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for givers,
# enders, objectives, droppers and spawns; Forever's Paladin class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/) for the rewards and that
# Forever leaves these quests unchanged; Warcraft Wiki, "Paladin quests"
# (warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Paladin_quests), for where the parts are: the
# Whitestone Oak Lumber from the Goblin Woodcarvers in the Deadmines, Jordan's
# Smithing Hammer on a box in the stables of Shadowfang Keep's courtyard, the
# ore crate in the Mo'grosh ogre camp, the Corrupted Kor Gem from the
# Blackfathom naga outside Blackfathom Deeps; dungeon entrances from
# dungeons.json (DungeonJournal, live map frame).
# Three parts are dungeon work (the Deadmines, Shadowfang Keep, the naga at
# Blackfathom Deeps, all elite) and the Mo'grosh ogres are elite: bring a
# group. The parts can be gathered in any order once Jordan has given you The
# Test of Righteousness.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Tome of Valor

step The Tome of Valor (Ironforge)
  only Dwarf
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 20 Tiza Battleforge in the Mystic Ward gives you the Tome of Valor; it sends you to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind's Cathedral of Light. Take the tram from Ironforge to Stormwind.
  level 20
  accept 1794                         -- Tiza Battleforge
  turnin 1794

step The Tome of Valor
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Duthorian Rall stands in the Cathedral of Light. Right-click the Tome of Valor to start its quest.
  level 20
  accept 1793 only Human              -- Duthorian Rall
  turnin 1793 only Human
  accept 1649                         -- from the Tome of Valor
  turnin 1649                         -- Duthorian Rall
  accept 1650

step Daphne Stilwell
  zone Westfall
  tip Daphne Stilwell's farmhouse stands on the south-west coast of Westfall. Waves of Defias attack it during her quest: keep her alive, and heal her if she needs it.
  turnin 1650                         -- Daphne Stilwell
  accept 1651
  complete 1651                       -- Protect Daphne Stilwell
  turnin 1651
  accept 1652

step Duthorian Rall
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 1652                         -- Duthorian Rall: Bastion of Stormwind
  accept 1653

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Test of Righteousness

step Jordan Stilwell
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Jordan Stilwell stands outside the gates of Ironforge. He gives you Jordan's Weapon Notes, which list the four parts.
  turnin 1653                         -- Jordan Stilwell
  accept 1654

step Bailor Stonehand
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Bailor Stonehand is in Thelsamar.
  accept 1655                         -- Bailor Stonehand

step Bailor's Ore
  tip The ore crate lies by the trees in the middle of the Mo'grosh ogre camp in north-east Loch Modan. The Mo'grosh ogres are elite: grouping up is advised.
  collect 6992 quest 1655.1           -- Bailor's Ore crate

step Back to Bailor
  tip Bailor turns the ore into Jordan's Refined Ore Shipment.
  turnin 1655                         -- Bailor Stonehand
  collect 6993 quest 1654.2

step Whitestone Oak Lumber
  zone Westfall
  tip The Deadmines is a group of five under Moonbrook; the instance portal is inside the Moonbrook mine. The Goblin Woodcarvers in the Mast Room, with Sneed, drop the lumber.
  goto 42.5,71.7 live "The Deadmines, in the Moonbrook mine"
  collect 6994 quest 1654.1 @42.5,71.7 live -- Goblin Woodcarvers, inside

step Jordan's Smithing Hammer
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Shadowfang Keep is a level 20-30 dungeon in southern Silverpine Forest. The hammer lies on a box inside the stables, at the far end of the courtyard before the ramp up.
  goto 44.8,67.8 live "Shadowfang Keep"
  collect 6895 quest 1654.3 @44.8,67.8 live -- Jordan's Hammer, inside

step Thundris Windweaver
  zone Darkshore
  tip Thundris Windweaver is in Auberdine.
  accept 1442                         -- Thundris Windweaver

step The Corrupted Kor Gem
  zone Ashenvale
  tip The Blackfathom naga by the entrance of Blackfathom Deeps on Ashenvale's north-west coast drop the Corrupted Kor Gem. They are elite: grouping up is advised.
  collect 6995 quest 1442.1

step The Purified Kor Gem
  zone Darkshore
  tip Back to Thundris in Auberdine: he purifies the gem.
  turnin 1442                         -- Thundris Windweaver
  collect 7083 quest 1654.4

step Verigan's Fist
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Bring the four parts to Jordan Stilwell outside Ironforge.
  turnin 1654                         -- Jordan Stilwell
  accept 1806
  turnin 1806                         -- Verigan's Fist
